Tom: It was amazing, Lucy. My favourite was a building shaped like a giant lotus flower.
Lucy: A lotus? What was special about it?
Tom: Its roof collects rainwater and sends it down to a small waterfall inside.
Lucy: That''s clever. So the water isn''t just thrown away?
Tom: No. It''s cleaned and then used again through the building''s pipes.
Lucy: I wish I had gone with you. Is the exhibition still open?
Tom: Yes, it runs until next Sunday. We could go together this weekend.
Lucy: Great. Let''s meet at the gate at nine on Saturday morning.
Tom: Perfect. Bring a notebook — there''s a lot worth drawing.', 'Lucy 问 Tom 昨天的绿色建筑展怎么样;Tom 说很棒,他最喜欢一座莲花形状的建筑,屋顶收集雨水并送到室内小瀑布;水经净化后通过管道再次使用;展览开到下周日,两人约定周六上午九点在门口见面。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which building did Tom like best at the exhibition?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["One shaped like a giant lotus flower.","One shaped like a tall tree.","One built completely of ice.","One floating on a river."]},{"q":"What does that building''s roof do?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It plays loud music.","It collects rainwater.","It blocks all the sunlight.","It stores food for winter."]},{"q":"What happens to the water inside the building?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is cleaned and used again.","It is sold to nearby shops.","It is poured into the sea.","It is left to dry up."]},{"q":"When will the exhibition close?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["This Friday.","Next Sunday.","Tomorrow afternoon.","Next month."]},{"q":"When do Lucy and Tom plan to meet?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["At noon on Sunday.","After school on Friday.","At nine on Saturday morning.","Early on Monday."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective3', 'U5', 'fltrp');
Mei: Thank you. I''m very happy to be here.
Host: What first made you interested in green design?
Mei: As a child I loved watching how plants and animals solved problems. I wanted buildings to do the same.
Host: Can you give us an example of your work?
Mei: Sure. Last year I designed a library with a roof garden that keeps the rooms cool in summer.
Host: That sounds wonderful. Was it difficult to build?
Mei: Yes. The hardest part was keeping the plants alive through the cold winter.
Host: What advice would you give to young students?
Mei: Go outside and watch nature closely. Your best ideas are already out there.', '节目采访年轻建筑师 Mei:她从小喜欢观察动植物如何解决问题,希望建筑也能如此;去年她设计了一座带屋顶花园的图书馆,夏天能让房间凉爽;最难的部分是让植物熬过寒冬;她建议学生多到户外仔细观察自然,最好的点子就在那里。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is Mei''s job?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["She is a young architect.","She is a school teacher.","She is a train driver.","She is a farmer."]},{"q":"What first made Mei interested in green design?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Reading books about famous cities.","Watching how plants and animals solved problems.","Travelling around the world.","Playing in a school band."]},{"q":"What did Mei design last year?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A bridge across a river.","A swimming pool.","A library with a roof garden.","A train station."]},{"q":"What was the hardest part of the project?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Finding enough money.","Choosing a name for it.","Painting the walls.","Keeping the plants alive through winter."]},{"q":"What advice does Mei give to students?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Go outside and watch nature closely.","Stay indoors and study books.","Copy other architects'' plans.","Wait for ideas to come by themselves."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective3', 'U5', 'fltrp');
Mr Lee: That''s a lovely idea, Anna. But have you thought about which plants to grow?
Anna: We were thinking of flowers and a few small vegetables.
Mr Lee: Good. Plants up there will give shade and help keep the top classrooms cool.
Anna: Exactly. And we could collect rainwater to water them.
Mr Lee: Very sensible. Who will look after the garden during the holidays?
Anna: Each group will take turns, even in summer.
Mr Lee: Then I''m happy to help. Let''s start planning next Monday.
Anna: Thank you so much! I''ll tell the whole class today.', 'Anna 提议班级在校园屋顶建一个小花园;Mr Lee 觉得主意不错,但问她想种什么植物;Anna 说花和一些小蔬菜;老师说屋顶植物能遮阴、让顶层教室凉爽;Anna 还想收集雨水浇灌;老师问假期谁照看,Anna 说各组轮流,夏天也不例外;老师答应帮忙,约定下周一开始规划。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Anna''s class want to build?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A new sports hall.","A pond in the playground.","A small garden on the school roof.","A library by the gate."]},{"q":"What does Mr Lee ask Anna to think about first?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["How much it will cost.","What colour to paint it.","When the school closes.","Which plants to grow."]},{"q":"How will the roof garden help the classrooms?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It will give shade and keep them cool.","It will make them warmer in summer.","It will block the noise outside.","It will bring in more light."]},{"q":"How do they plan to water the plants?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["By buying bottled water.","By collecting rainwater.","By using a deep well.","By carrying water from home."]},{"q":"Who will look after the garden during the holidays?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Only Mr Lee will.","Nobody will look after it.","Each group will take turns.","A gardener from the town."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective3', 'U5', 'fltrp');

